    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10512" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">consĭlĭātor</span></b> ,
			ōris, m.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				counsellor</i> (post-Aug. and rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">maleficus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Phaedr. 2, 6, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">consiliator et rector,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Ep. 4, 17, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bonus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 1, p. 107, 36</span></i>
			.—As an epithet of Jupiter, <i><span class="en">Inscr.
					Gud. p. 7</span></i>, n. 6.</div>
